'''Doom Paradise (Insane)''' is the [[Continuation Stage]] in [[Bad to Worse]]. It is very similar to [[Tragedy in Red (Insane)|the previous stage]], except with [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] instead of [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] enemies. When completed, it will drop an [[Catfruit|Epic Catfruit]].

