==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 3.33~6 seconds<sup>100f~180f</sup>.
*3 [[Two Can]]s spawn after 400 seconds<sup>12,000f</sup>, delay 200 seconds<sup>6,000f</sup>.
*10 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 4.67~10 seconds<sup>140f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Bun Bun Black]] spawns as the boss after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn, delay 40~53.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 30~43.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,300f</sup>.
**8 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 2~3.33 seconds<sup>60f~100f</sup>.
**1 [[Dark Cyclone]] spawns as the boss after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
**1 [[Director Kurosawah]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Focus on heavy damage dealers and the [[:Category:Cats with Slow ability|slow]] and [[:Category:Cats with Freeze ability|freeze]] effects over [[:Category:Cats with Knockback ability|knockback]]. You want to ideally draw the bosses out and maintain your distance from Director Kurosawah so he doesn't destroy your front line. Be aware that this is a timed stage, as Two Cans will spawn after some time and possibly cause you to lose the battle. Just like the last stage, beware the boss shockwaves. [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] can help by blocking waves, while [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]] and [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] are the main go-to Cats to keep the enemies in check.

